OL,3,GNEWSAWoman, 99, becomes world's oldest
OL,4,Awing walker
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 99-year-old woman has broken a record
OL,7,Fto become the world's oldest wing
OL,8,Fwalker.
OL,10,FHelga Duffy saw 97-year-old Betty
OL,11,FBromage doing the same thing on the
OL,12,Fnews and wanted to give it a try.
OL,14,FHelga - who said the wing walk feeling
OL,15,Fwas "peculiar" - now lives in a care
OL,16,Fhome in Devizes, Wiltshire, but lived
OL,17,Fin Frome in Somerset for many years.
OL,19,FHelga said of the flight where she was
OL,20,Fstrapped to the top of a small plane:
OL,21,F"I wasn't frightened because I was so
OL,22,Fexcited."
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
